      "tip": {
        "en": "sh is soft (she, ship); ch is harder (chair, teacher); j is like the start of July.",
        "hu": "A sh lágy (she, ship); a ch keményebb (chair, teacher); a j olyan, mint a July eleje."
      },
      "examples": [
